WEBVTT

00:06:59.079 --> 00:07:00.788
guess what? They make the
same amount of money.

00:07:01.079 --> 00:07:03.954
People don't have a problem seeing
diverse actors on screen

00:07:03.954 --> 00:07:05.038
or seeing diverse stories.

00:07:05.038 --> 00:07:07.704
What they want more than anything
is for those movies to be good.

00:07:08.246 --> 00:07:12.621
And what's the blacklist, I hope
has done is created more of

00:07:12.621 --> 00:07:16.246
a true meritocracy where the focus
is not who's in the movie,

00:07:16.371 --> 00:07:19.788
what's the movie about it simply
is this a good script?

00:07:20.246 --> 00:07:23.621
And probably one of the most
gratifying things about

00:07:23.621 --> 00:07:25.663
the sort of 15 year history
of the blacklist and.

00:07:25.704 --> 00:07:27.496
Up on 16 years is that last year,

00:07:27.496 --> 00:07:30.871
the Harvard Business School did
a study on the economics of